{"seq":3,"slug":"lc0332-reconstruct-itinerary","title":"LeetCode 332 重新安排行程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-graph-advanced/lc0332-reconstruct-itinerary","wordCount":799,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-332-重新安排行程\">LeetCode 332 重新安排行程</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给定一个航班列表 <code>tickets</code>，其中 <code>tickets[i] = [fromi, toi]</code> 表示一张从 <code>fromi</code> 飞往 <code>toi</code> 的机票。请按照以下规则重新安排行程：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>行程必须从 <code>&quot;JFK&quot;</code> 出发</li>\n<li>所有机票<strong>恰好使用一次</strong></li>\n<li>如果存在多种有效行程，返回<strong>字典序最小</strong>的那个</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>1 &lt;= tickets.length &lt;= 300</code></li>\n<li><code>tickets[i].length == 2</code></li>\n<li><code>fromi.length == 3</code></li>\n<li><code>toi.length == 3</code></li>\n<li><code>fromi</code> 和 <code>toi</code> 由大写英文字母组成</li>\n<li><code>fromi != toi</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：tickets = [[&quot;MUC&quot;,&quot;LHR&quot;],[&quot;JFK&quot;,&quot;MUC&quot;],[&quot;SFO&quot;,&quot;SJC&quot;],[&quot;LHR&quot;,&quot;SFO&quot;]]&#10;输出：[&quot;JFK&quot;,&quot;MUC&quot;,&quot;LHR&quot;,&quot;SFO&quot;,&quot;SJC&quot;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：tickets = [[\"MUC\",\"LHR\"],[\"JFK\",\"MUC\"],[\"SFO\",\"SJC\"],[\"LHR\",\"SFO\"]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[\"JFK\",\"MUC\",\"LHR\",\"SFO\",\"SJC\"]</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：tickets = [[&quot;JFK&quot;,&quot;SFO&quot;],[&quot;JFK&quot;,&quot;ATL&quot;],[&quot;SFO&quot;,&quot;ATL&quot;],[&quot;ATL&quot;,&quot;JFK&quot;],[&quot;ATL&quot;,&quot;SFO&quot;]]&#10;输出：[&quot;JFK&quot;,&quot;ATL&quot;,&quot;JFK&quot;,&quot;SFO&quot;,&quot;ATL&quot;,&quot;SFO&quot;]&#10;解释：另一种有效行程为 [&quot;JFK&quot;,&quot;SFO&quot;,&quot;ATL&quot;,&quot;JFK&quot;,&quot;ATL&quot;,&quot;SFO&quot;]，但字典序更大。\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：tickets = [[\"JFK\",\"SFO\"],[\"JFK\",\"ATL\"],[\"SFO\",\"ATL\"],[\"ATL\",\"JFK\"],[\"ATL\",\"SFO\"]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[\"JFK\",\"ATL\",\"JFK\",\"SFO\",\"ATL\",\"SFO\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：另一种有效行程为 [\"JFK\",\"SFO\",\"ATL\",\"JFK\",\"ATL\",\"SFO\"]，但字典序更大。</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p>本题的本质是在<strong>有向多重图</strong>中寻找<strong>欧拉路径</strong>（Eulerian Path）——一条恰好经过每条边一次的路径。</p>\n<p><strong>关键洞察：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>题目保证至少存在一个合理的行程（即欧拉路径一定存在）</li>\n<li>要求字典序最小，所以在选择下一个目的地时应优先选字典序最小的</li>\n<li>起点固定为 <code>&quot;JFK&quot;</code></li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Hierholzer 算法</strong> 是寻找欧拉路径/回路的标准算法。其核心思想是：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>从起点出发进行 DFS</li>\n<li>每次贪心地选择字典序最小的邻居</li>\n<li>当一个节点没有未使用的出边时，将其加入结果的<strong>头部</strong></li>\n<li>最终得到的逆序结果就是欧拉路径</li>\n</ul>\n<p>为什么要&quot;后序&quot;加入结果？考虑一种情况：从当前节点出发，有多条出边，其中一条边通往一个&quot;死胡同&quot;（只有入边没有未用出边的子图）。如果先走死胡同，DFS 会先返回，该节点先被加入结果。然后继续走其他分支。最后反转整个结果，死胡同节点就在路径末尾，确保了路径的正确性。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[建立邻接表并排序] --&gt; B[从 JFK 开始 DFS]&#10;    B --&gt; C{当前节点有未使用的边?}&#10;    C --&gt;|是| D[取出字典序最小的目的地]&#10;    D --&gt; E[递归访问该目的地]&#10;    E --&gt; C&#10;    C --&gt;|否| F[将当前节点加入结果头部]&#10;    F --&gt; G[回溯到上层]&#10;    G --&gt; C&#10;    B --&gt; H[反转结果得到欧拉路径]\">graph TD\n    A[建立邻接表并排序] --&gt; B[从 JFK 开始 DFS]\n    B --&gt; C{当前节点有未使用的边?}\n    C --&gt;|是| D[取出字典序最小的目的地]\n    D --&gt; E[递归访问该目的地]\n    E --&gt; C\n    C --&gt;|否| F[将当前节点加入结果头部]\n    F --&gt; G[回溯到上层]\n    G --&gt; C\n    B --&gt; H[反转结果得到欧拉路径]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>是否保证字典序</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Hierholzer（DFS 后序）</td>\n<td>O(E log E)</td>\n<td>O(V + E)</td>\n<td>是（排序邻接表）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>暴力回溯</td>\n<td>O(E!)</td>\n<td>O(E)</td>\n<td>是（需全部枚举）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BFS 变体</td>\n<td>不适用</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Hierholzer 算法是唯一高效且正确的解法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><p><strong>Hierholzer 算法（递归版）：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function findItinerary(tickets: string[][]): string[] {&#10;  const graph: Map&lt;string, string[]&gt; = new Map();&#10;&#10;  for (const [from, to] of tickets) {&#10;    if (!graph.has(from)) graph.set(from, []);&#10;    graph.get(from)!.push(to);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  for (const [, dests] of graph) {&#10;    dests.sort();&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const result: string[] = [];&#10;&#10;  const dfs = (node: string) =&gt; {&#10;    const dests = graph.get(node);&#10;    while (dests &amp;&amp; dests.length &gt; 0) {&#10;      const next = dests.shift()!;&#10;      dfs(next);&#10;    }&#10;    result.push(node);&#10;  };&#10;&#10;  dfs(&#39;JFK&#39;);&#10;  return result.reverse();&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> findItinerary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tickets</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[][])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> graph</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tickets) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">graph.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(from)) graph.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(from, []);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    graph.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(from)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(to);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dests</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> graph) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dests.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> dfs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">node</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> dests</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> graph.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (dests </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dests.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> next</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dests.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">shift</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      dfs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(next);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  dfs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'JFK'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reverse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Hierholzer 算法（迭代版）：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function findItineraryIterative(tickets: string[][]): string[] {&#10;  const graph: Map&lt;string, string[]&gt; = new Map();&#10;&#10;  for (const [from, to] of tickets) {&#10;    if (!graph.has(from)) graph.set(from, []);&#10;    graph.get(from)!.push(to);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  for (const [, dests] of graph) {&#10;    dests.sort();&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const stack: string[] = [&#39;JFK&#39;];&#10;  const result: string[] = [];&#10;&#10;  while (stack.length &gt; 0) {&#10;    const top = stack[stack.length - 1];&#10;    const dests = graph.get(top);&#10;    if (dests &amp;&amp; dests.length &gt; 0) {&#10;      stack.push(dests.shift()!);&#10;    } else {&#10;      result.push(stack.pop()!);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return result.reverse();&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> findItineraryIterative</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tickets</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[][])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> graph</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span